Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0JmFfcBbIux_vauRNWzD9Q","review_id":"s8PXPKoFiWM3x-RgHHKWBQ","date":"2021-08-21T21:05:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9360156059265137,"text_excerpt":"We have been waiting to go to Alma forever! Well finally, the weekend brunch came to be, and it was GLORIOUS. We got some pastelitos (small meat pies) to start, and they were amazing. Not a huge amount of food, so a really good appetizer, but cooked perfectly and served with a killer sauce. Nom! We also split the Pollo Chuco, which is a fried chicken with cabbage (seriously an awesome cabbage) and some sort of crazy sauce that is to die for. This was so delicious I could eat my weight. Insanely good. To round it out, we had the campechano breakfast, which has flank steak (cooked perfectly!) and eggs, beans, etc. with tortillas - basically the ingredients for breakfast tacos, and that is E..."},{"business_id":"0JmFfcBbIux_vauRNWzD9Q","review_id":"86gCBTovUtjlyRInZOIZ1A","date":"2020-11-17T04:31:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9298149347305298,"text_excerpt":"A gem of a new restaurant in Bywater. Delicious food that has elements both familiar and brand new / different; beautiful space and vibe; good service. Would strongly recommend and will be back. Came here for two meals - one breakfast, one lunch. Ordered the Alma breakfast and breakfast tacos. Alma breakfast was just dang good. The refried beans are unlike anything I've had. The breakfast tacos, in contrast, were near flavorless. It was almost like they forgot to put sauce / salsa / seasoning on the dish. Either way, the alma breakfast was good enough for me to come back for lunch. I ordered the rice and beans plus shrimp ceviche. Again, fabulous food. To top it all off the food here is r..."},{"business_id":"0JmFfcBbIux_vauRNWzD9Q","review_id":"QKGxv-ZjaCOrStPr5I1rig","date":"2021-12-22T23:24:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9289245009422302,"text_excerpt":"This place might not look like much when you drive by, but it is 100% worth the stop! The vibe is great, and the food is delicious! It's Honduran food done in a modern way. My husband tried the Alma breakfast which has mostly traditional foods like plantains, eggs, refried beans, avocado, and tortillas. He chose corn tortillas, and they were clearly homemade and yummy. The beans were incredibly flavorful, and the plantains weren't greasy at all. I had the Adult French Toast, and it was equally good. The whipped cream with herbs (thyme and rosemary) was a great addition. The chai latte was amazing, and my husband thoroughly enjoyed his vanilla latte. It was so good we went for breakfast tw..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0JmFfcBbIux_vauRNWzD9Q","photo_id":"BBOYW1bdpBI3Oh_oPhyXNg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BBOYW1bdpBI3Oh_oPhyXNg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9218109846115112},{"business_id":"0JmFfcBbIux_vauRNWzD9Q","photo_id":"nywAwYoPBmmxaMf0SCRpeQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/nywAwYoPBmmxaMf0SCRpeQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8631360530853271},{"business_id":"0JmFfcBbIux_vauRNWzD9Q","photo_id":"QmP6EU9lqV2yKaTWr9huqg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/QmP6EU9lqV2yKaTWr9huqg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7938351035118103},{"business_id":"0JmFfcBbIux_vauRNWzD9Q","photo_id":"FnNZP4Q6h1VhC3eL7zSdUg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FnNZP4Q6h1VhC3eL7zSdUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7663707733154297},{"business_id":"